eNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"86226","synopsis":"Veltol scopre in prima persona del tradimento del suo vecchio vassallo Marcus. Dopodiché, Machina gli fa fare un giro della città. Veltol fa fatica ad adattarsi al mondo futuro alterato, ma Machina gli presenta una persona.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dV8zxzgQTWE2O1msnwJ9aQ1bKzr.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"86349","synopsis":"Following the advice of Machina’s friend, Takahashi, Veltol begins streaming games with a face reveal. He spends his days establishing his image as a streamer, using Takahashi’s strategy and influence. Meanwhile, Veltol goes for a stroll through the back alleys of Shinjuku’s outskirts one day, and Veltol is intrigued by the sight of a particular vagabond.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pCLu1OYl4WVdyhxqjwtSwFy9MFr.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"86436","synopsis":"Veltol is asked to work as Takahashi’s bodyguard. Hoping to test the strength of his restored faith as well, Veltol planned to launch a surprise attack on the yakuza, but their run-of-the-mill heist leads to unexpected developments, swallowing the two of them deeper into the city’s dark underbelly.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ecnudmJT27zvJYE5H9TZMBwzwxY.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"86538","synopsis":"Machina lets her thoughts drift to Veltol as she prepares dinner. Meanwhile, Veltol learns new facts about the Immortal Furnace, and while he tries to inform Machina using Whisper magic, he gets no response. At the same time, Machina has an unexpected visitor…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8OCev7WSr4iLrGHDBDEQNUELIuL.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"86628","synopsis":"The Immortal Furnace lies directly below the Aether Reactor of Shinjuku, and Machina flies into a rage when Marcus reveals an appalling truth about immortals. Meanwhile, Kinohara stands in the way of Veltol’s group. After Gram takes an attack for him, Veltol issues his orders.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/quFWM6Y7p8irwQpf3EpZzMjlvYS.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"86715","synopsis":"Trusting Gram to handle Kinohara, Veltol reaches the Immortal Furnace. He grills Marcus about his betrayal of the immortals and why he kidnapped Machina. The legendary Demon Lord faces Shinjuku’s ruler. The former lord and vassal cross blades in this new world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hP7hJX790ykj9Y3MSA09RHWmqdS.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"86809","synopsis":"Hizuki Reynard-Yamada heaves another deep sigh in class at the Akihabara Private School of Magic \"Lu Xel\". Meanwhile, Veltol defeats Marcus and safely rescues Machina. What he seeks next lies somewhere in Akihabara City…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jRJyE05fNJDY3XX05BowGOhsjGt.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"86936","synopsis":"Veltol, Machina, and Takahashi infiltrate Lu Xel under the pretense of a short-term exchange program so they can search for the regalia. When the three sit around a table in the school cafeteria, the school’s top student—Albert—begins provoking Hizuki Reynard-Yamada, the woman seated nearby.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hvIle9xqPJbpq6WsGne6kmMsimo.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"87054","synopsis":"Veltol and the others go to Electric Town and visit the maid café Helheim, where Hizuki works. While experiencing the unique services the maid café provides, Veltol asks Hizuki about the regalia. Afterward, the four head out into Electric Town where they encounter a certain someone.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gUSOnODrc45dS0XZ8EYEWSqbwQc.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"87176","synopsis":"After heading out into Electric Town, Veltol’s group visits the mansion of the Reynard family. After entertaining them, Hizuki heads for the bathroom… only to find Veltol already there! The next day, Hizuki hears people talking about the explosion in Electric Town.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hbNSGFwkeAuqZJcRXCMocy7jQy.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"87225","synopsis":"Thanks to Mag Rosanta’s plot, the goddess Meldia has manifested by using Hizuki as a vessel. Veltol battles Meldia in an attempt to save Hizuki. Meanwhile, Machina faces a young girl wearing a visor. What will happen to Akihabara City and the conflict between Electric Town and Magic Town?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2iq4ALBeAEWe48F4j6bXsjh042O.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":163135,"malId":54853},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:163135","mal:54853"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17943","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"163135","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"54853","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234538","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432847","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":5675,"title":"Maou 2099","title_eng":"Demon Lord 2099","slug":"demon-lord-2099","plot":"La storia è ambientata a Shinjuku nell'anno 2099 dell'Era Fused. L'abbagliante prosperità di questa enorme città-stato nasconde una spaventosa oscurità appena sotto la sua superficie. È qui, in questa megalop